{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1794936714754809718,"compiled_state":{"alias":"tame-melodious-veery","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":3,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"5cd05a99be8c9675218d44ee08a918c0eea548d88880510b88799d33fce6c05b","event_uuid":"6e78e2ef-d8fb-45e3-8fd7-c265127baa3b","position":{"commit_sha":"2286cdcd6a402190771a8a95c75e2a8fb9b05a3a","position":"1794936698038781473-6e78e2ef-d8fb-45e3-8fd7-c265127baa3b"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"99c68128151700567e543b7e96aac916f9e495a7788ac3b0b169ff83db72c85d","event_uuid":"a89df801-83a3-4337-8d3d-6e39f8e65a54","position":{"commit_sha":"49b2ee26833e4c75722712359c07ff7726888b87","position":"1794936708182416992-a89df801-83a3-4337-8d3d-6e39f8e65a54"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"71ee265a47b0641e18df66d590b6c099be5e43f1e3e5e967e0d8a25966b3845d","event_uuid":"634b6fc2-5309-482d-b771-ed30c3b30e5e","position":{"commit_sha":"c3738aa1211156a60e51966e9389f21c33857f1d","position":"1794936714754809717-634b6fc2-5309-482d-b771-ed30c3b30e5e"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1794936698038781473,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"a89df801-83a3-4337-8d3d-6e39f8e65a54","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"8dc4-1541-92a7-4351"},{"link_uuid":"634b6fc2-5309-482d-b771-ed30c3b30e5e","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"a2c7-c9a9-ed63-4c5a"}],"description":"## Observation\n\nOn 2026-11-17, I ran `python -m rebar verify-identity --all` in enforced mode (`REBAR_IDENTITY_REQUIRE_AUTHENTICATED=1`) on a TMPDIR dry-run copy of the reclaimed tickets history. The copy came from `origin/tickets` e7a0476397f, collapsed with a 30-day horizon. The python process sat at 0% CPU, polling a pipe, while a child ran:\n\n`git log --diff-filter=A --full-history --no-renames --format=%H -- *<position>*`\n\nThat child was at about 98% CPU, one ledger position at a time.\n\nThis is the per-position fallback `authorship.resolve_position_commit`, called from `_resolve_position` in `src/rebar/_commands/verify_authorship.py` when `build_position_commit_map` has no entry. After a reclaim, no commit on the rewritten branch adds a below-checkpoint event's file. Every such ledger position therefore misses the batched map and costs one full-history walk. An earlier run of the same command on the same copy had not finished after about 3.5 hours.\n\n## What is not established\n\n- The miss count, and the share of the runtime it accounts for, have not been measured.\n- The advisory mode that CI uses today (`require_authenticated = false`) is O(events). It finished in seconds on the same copy, reporting 49,438 signed and 874 unsigned events (50,312 in scope), identical before and after the reclaim.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Root cause measured on a dry-run copy: the number of fallback calls, and the runtime with and without them.\n- [ ] Enforced `verify-identity --all` on a reclaimed copy of the real store completes in time comparable to the same run on the unreclaimed copy, shown by timing both on one dry-run workdir.\n","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","536b-8930-b922-4063"],["relates_to","a2c7-c9a9-ed63-4c5a"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"536b-8930-b922-4063","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"84f6-ac03-4044-44d5","ticket_type":"bug","title":"verify-identity on a reclaimed store runs a full-history git log per below-checkpoint ledger entry","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["6e78e2ef-d8fb-45e3-8fd7-c265127baa3b","a89df801-83a3-4337-8d3d-6e39f8e65a54","634b6fc2-5309-482d-b771-ed30c3b30e5e"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1794936714754809718,"uuid":"d67026dd-0a64-4924-9806-2525262b31f8"}
